# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5
# Checkpoints of a Python simulation (D223) on the CPU in
# mixed precision, scenario python-to-cli of Inputs/python_checkpoints.py.
# A Python simulation writes its checkpoint at step 10 and `mdir run
# --continue` takes it to step 20: equal to a Python continuation of the
# same file and to the run of `mdir run` that did not stop, to the bit,
# with the energy file and the trajectory byte for byte.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_checkpoints.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide CPU Mixed mdir %t python-to-cli | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: Python -> mdir run NVE CPU Mixed
# CHECK: Python -> mdir run NVT CPU Mixed
# CHECK: Python -> mdir run NPT CPU Mixed
# CHECK: checkpoints python-to-cli CPU Mixed passed
